From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bron Gondwana <brong@fastmailteam.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 22:46:19 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Add a per-list dkim2_message_instance flag

With [mta] message_instance on for the site, a list can opt out:
dkim2_message_instance (default True, in the REST list configuration
resource) turns off Message-Instance headers, the decoration change and
the From rule for that list, and its posts carry no arrival record or
header log through the queues.  Lists from before the migration that
adds the column are treated as enabled.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
